      "data": {
        "label": "EXAMPLE — C4 Context: Ticketing & Booking Platform\n\nIllustrates: the top level of a C4 drill-down (Context → Container → Component), using linked-diagram navigation.\nPersona: a technical/solution architect on Meridian Rail's modernization task force, scoping the new booking platform.\n\nReading this diagram: blue = the system in scope. Purple = human actors. Grey = external/existing systems. Solid edges are ongoing relationships; the dashed edge is transitional (being retired during migration). Click any shape for a fuller description — a real legend feature is tracked as epic 0037, not built yet.\n\nPart of the Meridian Rail example gallery — epic 0022 (docs/planning/epics/0022-example-diagram-gallery.md)."
      }
    },
